<p>Locking this thread as another exists for the same concept in progress. Reviewers, please comment here: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/t-13945918/any-suggestion-for-my-first-scp-feel-free-to-comment">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/t-13945918/any-suggestion-for-my-first-scp-feel-free-to-comment</a></p>
<p>As per the Ideas Critique forum required reading: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-13282684/required-reading:how-to-use-this-forum-ideas">http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-13282684/required-reading:how-to-use-this-forum-ideas</a> Please do not create multiple threads for the same working concept. Using one thread helps keep spam down, and prevents flooding of the forums with repeat threads. Furthermore, it helps reviewers a lot if all corresponding feedback is kept in one place so they can follow the development of the idea and its details.</p>
<p>If you're having trouble getting further replies on a thread, you can look at this thread for options to contact reviewers: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-13282692/how-to-get-more-reviews">http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-13282692/how-to-get-more-reviews</a></p>

