<p>Hello hello <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-juhan" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7143476); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7143476&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608400613" alt="Doctor Juhan" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7143476)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-juhan" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7143476); return false;">Doctor Juhan</a></span>! Welcome to the Wiki! I'm Ralliston, a site author and a member of the Community Outreach Team - with this helpful little comment, I'll try to help you find your way around the site and link a bunch of useful places and links that will help you in your SCP journey.</p>
<p>YouTube is quite the introduction power to the SCP Universe it seems! It's awesome to see you decided to join our ~official site~ after being a fan for quite a time - you'd be surprised at how many people don't do that and just stay in the shadows.</p>
<p>Without further ado though, let's click the collapsible, shall we?</p>
